OL,3,AHigher petrol and diesel prices push UK
OL,4,Ainflation to 3.6%
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation risks being pushed higher in
OL,7,Fthe coming months. Gas and electricity
OL,8,Fbills are forecast to jump by 26% in
OL,9,FJanuary, according to consultancy
OL,10,FCornwall Insight, adding #443 to annual
OL,11,Fhousehold energy costs when a new price
OL,12,Fcap comes into force.
